==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Vaporeon|34}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Vaporeon}}.
*'''Bubble Drain''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Everyone's Exciting Battle|Azumarill|12}} from the {{TCG|Everyone's Exciting Battle}} collection.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

